        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b> Deltana DSH35R4, 3-1/2\" x 3-1/2\" x 1/4\" Radius Single Action Spring Hinge</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nPackaged complete with One Single Action Spring Door Hinge, Allen Wrench, Adjusting Pin, Locking Pin plus #9 x 3/4\" Wood  Screws and #9 x 1/2\" machine screws. Utilizes template screw hole pattern for use with wood or metal doors. Available in 9 different finishes.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe included Allen Wrench Tool is use to adjust spring tension.  The Locking Pin holds the Spring in tension after it is set. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThese adjustable tension spring hinges allow you to determine how much closing force you apply  to the door (how hard/fast the door self closes). \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p align=\"center\">\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/DEL-DSH35R4-specifications.gif?v=1704354679\" width=\"526\" height=\"263\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Deltana DSH35R4 Hinge Specifications\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the 3-1/2: Single Action Spring Hinge:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Hinge Material: Durable Steel</li>\r\n<li>Height: 3-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Width: 3-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Corners: 1/4\" Radius</li>\r\n<li>Thickness: 0.097\" (Residential)</li>\r\n<li>Standard Template Hole Pattern</li>\r\n<li>Wood Screws: #9 x 3/4\"</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/DEL-DSH35R4.pdf?v=1704262171\" target=\"new\"><b>Deltana DSH35R4 Hinge Specifications (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>*Sold Individually</b>\r\n</p>",
